                                "sense_id": "7e3ee59e-f4e1-37f4-9651-3aca73b55a47",
                                "text": "A few years ago, you may remember, I turned up the medical term \"ice cream headache,\" which is completely unmedical in that you don't have to consult a doctor to find out what it means."
